title: ClawMachine
---
<<declare $claw_interaction_times = 0>>
<<declare $has_bunny = false>>
It's a claw machine.
You swear it's rigged, yet you still don't have evidence to prove it.
Play?

-> Yes
 <<if $claw_interaction_times ==2>>
  You ran out of tokens.
 <<else>>
  <<DoClawMachine ArcadeClawMachine>>
  <<if $claw_interaction_times ==0>>
   It's so hard to win at these.    
  <<set $claw_interaction_times = 1>>
  <<else>>
   <<set $has_bunny = true>>
   <<PlaySound InteractionManager "Pickup">>
   You won a pink bunny!
  <<endif>>
 <<endif>>
-> No
===
